TraceCommons Server

This repository was initially extracted from Ironclaw's `gecko-pass` worktree.
See `imports/ironclaw-server/SOURCE.md` for the source snapshot and extraction
mapping.

TraceCommons Server is distributed under MIT OR Apache-2.0.

The contributor's economizer (`crates/trace-commons-contributor/src/economizer`)
is an independent implementation of mechanisms described in Microsoft's
TokenEconomizer (https://github.com/microsoft/TokenEconomizer, arXiv
2610.22732). It contains no TokenEconomizer code.
